c0c5416e16c") (property "Reference" "H1" (at 355.60 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Value" "M2" (at 355.60 98.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Footprint" "MountingHole:MountingHole_2.2mm_M2" (at 355.60 101.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "Datasheet" "~" (at 355.60 101.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))  (instances (project "pcb-13-charge-inlet" (path "/4b5d0e5a-ef65-5dd3-9677-52b4254c1d40" (reference "H1") (unit 1))))) (symbol (lib_id "Mechanical:MountingHole") (at 370.84 101.60 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom no) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "730eed78-e844-5e5c-80e8-f949dc636306") (property "Reference" "H2" (at 370.84 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Value" "M2" (at 370.84 98.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Footprint" "MountingHole:MountingHole_2.2mm_M2" (at 370.84 101.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "Datasheet" "~" (at 370.84 101.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))  (instances (project "pcb-13-charge-inlet" (path "/4b5d0e5a-ef65-5dd3-9677-52b4254c1d40" (reference "H2") (unit 1))))) (text "PCB-13 charge inlet, rev A. Spec: charge-path.md sec 3 (D-040), inputs frozen in D-069 (04-pcbs/pcb-13-charge-inlet/README.md).\nJ1 GCT USB4140-GF-0170-C on the -X (panel) face, hand-soldered by the builder (D-069): VBUS A9/B9, GND A12/B12 and the four shell stakes (SH), CC1 A5, CC2 B5.\nD1 TVS2200 (22 V stand-off, 28.35 V max clamp) and C1 at J1; D2 ESDA25W on CC1/CC2. Everything on VBUS is rated >= 28 V.\nU1 STUSB4500 auto-run sink, NVM 5/9/15 V at 1.5 A with POWER_ONLY_ABOVE_5V (sec 8). Dead battery: CC1DB-CC1, CC2DB-CC2. VSYS to GND (unused).\nQ1 STL6P3LLH6: S on VBUS, D on VSNK; body diode blocks VSNK -> VBUS before a contract. R3 100k / R4 33k: VGS = -0.75 x VBUS. C5: tau 2.5 ms soft start.\nR1 1k 0805 anti-surge on VBUS_VS_DISCH (20 mA, 0.4 W pulses at 20 V); R2 470 R 1206 anti-surge DISCH -> VSNK (32 mA at 15 V).\nR5-R7 100k: ADDR0, ADDR1, RESET low (address 0x28); the NVM jig drives them through the test pads. ALERT, GPIO, POWER_OK3, A_B_SIDE, NC: no connection.\nTP1-TP5 programming (VBUS, GND, SCL, SDA, RESET) on a 2.54 mm grid for P75 pogos; TP6-TP10 probing. SCL/SDA pull-ups (3.3 V) are on the jig.\nJ2: W16 solder pads, pin 1 VSNK, pin 2 GND, to PCB-02 J2-8 (pin 1 VSNK, pin 2 GND). H1, H2: 2.2 mm holes at +-11 mm for the M2 x 5 screws (BO-017)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "030645f7-a741-5da4-bb58-69b38f3cdbf9")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
